-- armed sources that are not due cost nothing (first, before any other is armed)
armed/none: ok%
-- PLAY TONE's end
tone ends: 1  after ok
-- ADC START with an interrupt
adc done: 1
-- DAC START with two arrays and an interrupt
dac done: 1  second channel: 3000
-- the COUNT5 interrupt (PIN(18) = n moves the high word)
count interrupts: 2
-- a sprite collision
apart: 0
overlapping: 1
-- MODE's frame interrupt (mode 8 is 75 Hz), and MODE without one
frames in 1 s: ok  after: 0
-- ON KEY
keys?
on key: 4  abc<cr>
-- ON KEY armed with keys already waiting
early?
waiting keys: 2  q<cr>
-- ON KEY k
more?
on key y: 1  buffered: xz<cr>
done
